WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.430
<b>Tokachi Kashiwa Yuukai Equestrian Club</b>

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:05.810
Man, this looks ridiculous on me.

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:06.930
Really?

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:11.080
You guys are tall enough 
that it looks good on you.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:12.680
I, on the other hand...

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:13.860
Really?

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.570
But they say "clothes make the man."

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.890
They also say "clothes should 
reflect who you are."

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.290
Crap, crap crap...

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:33.540
I can't believe I have to do this 
in front of so many people!

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:34.890
Yo!

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:36.740
Ah, Ookawa-kun.

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:37.970
Ookawa-senpai!

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:40.650
We're in trouble!

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:42.930
Please give us some advice!

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:45.900
{*cough*} Oh, all right.

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:49.940
You're all worthless!

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:51.780
So what if you're <i>Homo sapiens</i>

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:54.840
of the Primate order and Hominidae family?

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:57.270
Your species' name may sound grand, 
but horses are far superior in physical ability!

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:59.510
Without horses, Hokkaido would 
never have been developed!

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:02.120
Our beloved Ooezo Agricultural High School 
would never have come into existence!

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.340
Horses are the foundation of all things!

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.320
They are gods!

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:07.090
You can all just sit astride 
those noble beings—

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:09.150
no, be allowed to sit astride them,

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:10.640
and let them handle the rest!

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:12.550
Got that, you worthless worms?!

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.320
I'm sorry I was born...

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:17.370
I'm a worthless maggot...

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.220
Ah, so to summarize,

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:26.440
just trust in your horse 
as you do in practice.

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:31.230
Once you jump over one obstacle, 
look at the next obstacle.

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:36.120
Then your horse will figure 
things out and guide you.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.950
Oh, yeah, that!

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.990
That's what I wanted to say.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:15.080
<b>Fall Chapter, Episode 4

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:13.570
Aw, I'm getting nervous, too!

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:16.250
You've been in competitions before.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.790
You even entered one on 
the fly, the other day.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.560
But that was my hometown!

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.180
A lot of things are different.

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:28.770
You're so pathetic, getting all flustered 
over a small regional competition!

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:31.850
Mikage Aki, you are a small-timer!

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:34.810
Oh, Ayame-chan, long time no see!

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:38.500
Don't address me by my first name!

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:41.100
My status far exceeds yours.

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:43.670
Is she from a good family?

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:46.670
She's the granddaughter of the local 
agricultural co-op union president.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.910
She's Minamikujou Ayame-chan.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:50.790
That's a really beautiful horse!

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:55.680
I had her specially delivered from abroad!

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:58.750
She's head and shoulders above 
your retired race horse!

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:00.190
Is she rich?

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.510
She was super excited when 
they built an expressway

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:05.520
because her family sold off their 
land at a really good price.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:06.940
You went to the same junior high?

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:07.880
Yeah.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.970
We applied to Ezonoo together.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:10.680
Huh?

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.440
That means... she didn't get in.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:15.320
Shut up!

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.200
Who the hell are you?!

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:20.420
I'm Hachiken, an Ezonoo 
first-year in dairy science.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.810
Your name has been committed to memory!

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:25.570
I will crush you, along with 
Mikage Aki, at this competition!

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:28.330
Just you wait... Shichiken!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:29.990
You already forgot it!

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:34.250
Man, I don't have the time 
to be dealing with idiots...

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.190
The hell?!

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:40.590
What're you doing?!

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.070
That's my line.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:45.590
It's your fault for going behind 
a horse with this mark.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.210
So, Mikage Aki!

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:51.060
This is the last day you can go 
around acting all high and mighty!

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:54.270
First, we'll square off in the 
C division small obstacle jump!

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:56.290
Oh, but I'm not in that.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:59.060
The C division is for beginners.

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.780
I see you've run from me, Mikage Aki!

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:03.410
You are no one to fear!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:07.110
I'll start competing from the 
B division small obstacle jump.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:07.990
She's so annoying...

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:12.950
Ooezo Agricultural High School's 
Maruyama-kun is about to start on Miyako.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.080
Go!

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:16.540
Whoa!

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:19.580
Because he knocked down the entire gate,

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:23.390
he gets four penalties and 
a six-second time penalty.

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:26.550
The rider with the fewest
 number of penalties will win.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:29.330
If there are riders with the 
same number of penalties,

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.650
the one with a shorter time
 will be ranked higher.

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:34.860
Next is number nine,

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:38.550
West Shimizu High School's 
Minamikujou-san on De Royal.

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:41.440
You, there!

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.730
Uh, Roku...

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:44.890
It's Hachi, okay? Hachi!

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:48.440
It appears Mikage Aki has fled 
in terror from this division,

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:50.450
so I've chosen to focus on you, instead!

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:52.950
Jeez, stop this!

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:56.410
Start!

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:02.160
Oh! A refusal from the start!

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:04.040
A penalty already!

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.910
That horse is amazing!

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.180
The rider's amazing, too! She looks like 
she'd fall, but she doesn't!

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:17.890
Time is up.

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:20.170
Minamikujou-san, you are disqualified.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.020
What?!

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:23.230
I cannot accept that!

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:26.650
Don't you want to keep 
watching beauty in action?!

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:30.070
Yeah, it's fun to watch an idiot.

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:30.860
Really?

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:35.620
<i>We have a good rhythm going! 
I might get a pretty good score...</i>

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.020
Hey...

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:38.620
Maron, this way! This way!

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.980
Number 18, Sakae-san on Maron,

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:46.520
finished in 58.21 seconds with 8 penalties.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.740
<i>Sakae let her guard down, huh...</i>

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:55.010
<i>I will be careful and thorough...</i>

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:59.600
<i>All right! No mistakes!</i>

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:04.230
Kino-kun and Ebisu finished 
 in 69.51 seconds with 3 penalties.

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.890
Crap! I went over time!

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:08.990
Our first-years are a mess.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.490
This is good experience.

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:18.510
Next up is number 25, Ooezo Agricultural 
High School's Hachiken-kun on Maron.

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:21.210
Hachiken, salute!

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:23.250
Oh, uh...

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:25.440
Use your right hand!

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:26.660
Right! Uh...

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.280
<i>Um... Umm... What was it?</i>

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.360
<i>What's next?</i>

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:33.730
<i>Crap, you guys!</i>

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.390
<i>Lend me your strength!</i>

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:40.810
<i>Pay a little attention!</i>

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.570
Good luck, Hachiken!

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:44.670
Go for it!

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:45.670
Good luck!

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:46.830
Go, Hachiken-kun!

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.300
Go for it, Hachiken!

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:48.300
You can do it!

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:54.370
<i>Everyone's watching me...</i>

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:58.450
<i>I have to show them... how cool I can be...</i>

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:01.620
<i>How cool I can be...</i>

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:03.020
<i>How cool I...</i>

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.300
I'm not cool at all!

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.850
I'm a worthless maggot, 
so it's all up to you!

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:21.060
I'm counting on you, Maron!

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:26.310
Start.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:31.600
<i>Focus on Maron's every movement!</i>

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:35.700
<i>If I put my mind to it, 
I can focus like no one else!</i>

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:39.550
<i>Results aside, if I just concentrate 
on staying focused...</i>

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.660
<i>I'll come out on top!</i>

00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:45.920
He's faster than usual.

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:51.690
<i>Just two more...</i>

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:52.650
<i>Focus...</i>

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:53.420
<i>Focus...</i>

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:54.990
<i>Focus...</i>

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:01.830
<i>Wh-Wh-Wh...</i>

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:03.180
<i>Why's my brother here?!</i>

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.650
<i>Wait a minute... this isn't good!</i>

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:08.130
Hey, look.

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:10.960
The stirrup!

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:11.620
Huh?

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:13.830
His right foot came out of the stirrup!

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:16.430
<i>Crap, crap, crap!</i>

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:17.490
<i>I'm gonna fall!</i>

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:18.780
Last one!

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:20.830
I'm gonna fall!

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:27.160
Shoot! They're going even faster!

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.420
Maron hates losing.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:32.550
Cleared the last one!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.170
Hachiken!

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:38.800
You're still okay!

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:40.450
Tough it out, Hachiken!

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:41.790
As long as you don't fall off the horse,

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.060
you won't be disqualified!

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:46.310
Easy enough for you to say!

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.570
Almost there!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.730
Cling to him like your life depends on it!

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.590
I can't... do it...

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:57.200
Hachiken!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.450
Hachiken-kun!

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:00.870
Are you all right?!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:01.780
Hachiken-kun!

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:05.290
Are you okay, Hachiken-kun?

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:07.040
The finish line!

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.500
Did my finish count?

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.260
Or did I get disqualified?

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:13.120
No, we don't know yet.

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:14.660
They're deliberating.

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:19.510
They're taking a long time.

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:23.390
Thank you for waiting.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:28.770
Ooezo Agricultural High School's 
Hachiken-kun and Maron

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:34.680
finished with a time of 52.98 
seconds and 0 penalties.

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:40.610
Yeah!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:41.400
That was great!

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:42.690
You've got balls, man!

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:45.240
They liked his run more than mine?!

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:47.080
Now I'm really going to get him!

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:49.350
Someone wants to kill me!

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:50.040
Who?!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:51.860
Hey, Yuugo!

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:52.910
You're working hard, I see!

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:53.790
Oh, right!

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.030
Why are you here?

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:56.580
It's Hachiken's bro!

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:57.440
I'm working part-time at a 
Mongolian barbecue restaurant.

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:58.170
The guy with the killer yakisoba!

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:01.120
I was doing a delivery when I saw you.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:02.770
You looked cool.

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:05.510
You've manned up, Yuugo.

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:07.370
Well... I guess.

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:09.620
I do put in effort every day, you know—

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:12.320
Yeah, you were super cool.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.650
I took a pic of your heroic run, 
so I'll send it on to Mom.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:23.330
Man, Yuugo... You've really 
manned up, huh? You jerk!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:26.660
Don't make the mistake of 
thinking I'm still the old me!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.490
What's Hachiken-kun's position right now?

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:31.080
Oh, third!

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:33.840
Whoa, do you think he'll go on the podium?

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.060
How many more people are left to go?

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:36.050
Just one!

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:38.310
The podium...

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:41.470
I might go on the podium?

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:45.060
Number 26 is Ooezo University of 
Agriculture and Veterinary Medicine's

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:47.360
Hagigaoka-kun on Double Eight.

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:55.540
He's not that fast.

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:57.740
Looks like Hachiken can win!

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.660
Nah, this guy's good.

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:00.310
Huh?

00:12:00.310 --> 00:12:03.160
He's good at rounding the curves.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.980
He might look like he's taking it slow,

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:06.680
but he's taking the shortest route.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:07.480
Then...

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:10.330
Yeah, he might get a better 
time than Hachiken.

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:12.060
Oh, no!

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:13.040
He'll beat me!

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:16.500
I wish he'd knock down 
a rail or something...

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.550
<i>He has a long way to go if he's praying 
for someone else to make a mistake...</i>

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:21.220
Last one!

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:22.720
Whoa!

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:31.570
Hagigaoka-kun and Double Eight

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:35.520
finished in 51.93 seconds with 0 penalties.

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:40.240
We now have the results for the 
C division small obstacle jump.

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:43.410
First place: Nishimiya-kun and Silky Snow.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.880
Second place: Ootsu-san and Duram.

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:49.420
Third place: Hagigaoka-kun and Double Eight.

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.900
Fourth place: Hachiken-kun and Maron.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:54.450
Fifth place: Seta-kun and Hokushin...

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:56.140
Fourth...

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:57.960
That was so close, Hachiken!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.290
It was so close!

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:04.970
But I finished fourth out of twenty-six!

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.430
Don't be greedy!

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:10.190
Ugh. So muddy...

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:13.030
The dirt they have in these 
arenas really stinks.

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:15.790
I still can't get used to the horse smell.

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:20.090
They're smelly, huge, and won't 
do what you tell them to...

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:23.470
Joining the equestrian club
 wasn't even my idea.

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.530
It's not like I wanted to be 
in the competition, either...

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:28.290
<i>Wait a minute...</i>

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:31.300
<i>But I still made it to fourth. 
That's great, right?</i>

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:32.770
<i>Isn't it impressive?</i>

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.590
<i>Over and beyond expectations?</i>

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:36.250
<i>I can be more confident now, right?</i>

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:40.170
<i>And yet...</i>

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:44.860
<i>Why do I feel so bad about it?!</i>

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:53.010
The next event will be the 
B division small obstacle jump.

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:56.350
The allotted time for course 
completion is 50 seconds.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:58.810
We will begin at 11:15.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:02.980
All right!

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.450
I gotta cheer senpai and Mikage on!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:09.570
Did you go to the infirmary 
to get yourself checked out?

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.440
Yes, I'm fine.

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:14.970
This time, you kept a firm grip 
on the reins when you fell.

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:16.500
Oh, right. I wasn't really 
thinking about it...

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:20.610
But you shouldn't keep holding on 
to them once you reach the ground.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:23.960
You might get dragged by the 
horse and get yourself hurt.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:27.280
So once you feel the ground 
under you, let go.

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:30.740
Always review safety measures!

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.680
Okay, I'll be more careful!

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:33.660
Okay!

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:36.860
Let go of the reins right 
away once you fall

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:40.940
so that you don't get dragged by 
the horse and get yourself hurt...

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:45.320
It's not easy to watch you get 
yourself hurt over it.

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.860
Oh, you're switching to Maron?

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:54.240
Yeah, Miyako's not doing so well.

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:57.440
Is it going to be okay, 
switching your horse last-minute?

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:59.420
Maron will be fine.

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.000
He's really good.

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:02.180
Really?

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:04.540
But he's a tough horse to deal with.

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:06.100
Yeah, I guess.

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:07.970
Each horse has a different personality.

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:11.590
But I kind of like the tough ones!

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:16.610
I hope I can bring out all of his ability!

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.530
Shoot, I'm getting nervous!

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:21.310
You'll be fine, Mikage—

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:24.900
Getting nervous over this 
little thing? Pathetic!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.650
You're not worthy of being 
my rival, Mikage Aki!

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:29.600
Mikage's up at the next event,

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:32.250
so stop putting unnecessary pressure on her!

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:34.540
Oh? This is a competition.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:36.230
Don't be a pansy!

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:38.620
Ayame-chan, you were always the strong one.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:39.910
That's right!

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.750
I was always at the front, being a leader!

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:45.090
Ayame-chan, wait!

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:46.350
Keep up!

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:48.440
Manure pit!

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:50.040
I was a trendsetter in fashion!

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:52.290
I went to the JUSCO in Kushiro!

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.280
Manure!

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:55.890
I had so much charisma!

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:57.210
You're the only one who can!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:57.670
We're counting on you!

00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:58.090
Please!

00:15:58.090 --> 00:15:59.230
Leave it to me!

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:01.850
Hey, melon thief!

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:06.360
You've got years to go before 
you can square off with me!

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:10.060
Yeah, I want to be a strong person, too.

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.700
Thanks, Ayame-chan!

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:17.780
Minamikujou, I'll give you a carrot later.

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:18.620
Why?!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:23.890
Next is number 13, Ooezo Agricultural 
High School's Mikage-san on Maron.

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:29.280
I guess Mikage from Kumaushi 
Equestrian Club went to Ezonoo.

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:29.880
Start.

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:30.250
She any good?

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:31.730
In practice, yeah.

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:34.940
But she makes lots of small 
mistakes at the actual competition.

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:37.250
Guess she's not so good on the big stage.

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:40.930
I bet she's never made 
it on the podium before.

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:44.830
Oh, looking good.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:45.700
She's so fast!

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.380
Isn't she going too fast?

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:51.790
<i>It really feels good when 
you can land clean jumps...</i>

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:56.160
Oh, she'll fall—

00:16:58.220 --> 00:16:59.200
She recovered!

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:01.090
Sorry, Maron!

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:02.440
I got distracted!

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:03.790
Thanks for covering for me!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:06.540
Don't worry about me.

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:10.050
Just jump the way you jump best!

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:15.780
All right! She's doing well.

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:18.290
It must feel great when 
you can ride that well.

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:19.660
It sure makes you jealous.

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:21.560
She's so insanely good, 
I can't even get jealous.

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:26.760
She's keeping up the pace.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.440
Looks like she'll get a good time.

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:29.900
Last one!

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:34.150
Goal!

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:40.080
Mikage-san and Maron finished in 
43.79 seconds with 0 penalties.

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:41.830
She's totally number one!

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:44.040
Thanks, Maron! That was awesome!

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:46.570
Maron, you were really awesome!

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:48.580
That's the Maron I know and love!

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:50.330
Maro...

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:53.310
Hey... Maron?

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:59.420
Maybe horses gravitate toward 
people who can ride them well...

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:01.440
Hey!

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:05.100
Was our friendship this fragile?!

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:10.070
Hey, he's looking at me like I'm a maggot.

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:12.630
This is ticking me off! 
I'm jealous of you right now!

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:13.580
What?!

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:20.910
Kashiwano-kun and Sonic finished 
in 42.91 seconds with 0 penalties.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.860
Ouch, Mikage got beat!

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:25.080
Wow, so many good riders!

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:27.800
You don't feel down about it?

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:30.230
Well, sure!

00:18:30.230 --> 00:18:31.880
I'm feel bad about things like

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:34.560
how I got distracted and 
made my horse uneasy,

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:37.550
how I couldn't sync my timing to his jumps,

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:42.550
and how I could do a better job at figuring 
out what the horses are feeling.

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:43.510
Sure, I feel down.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:45.860
But you can't fix <i>that</i>.

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:47.670
Your dad was saying it, too,

00:18:47.670 --> 00:18:50.720
but you can't really get 
inside a horse's head.

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:51.980
I know...

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:55.320
But I don't want to stop trying.

00:18:57.080 --> 00:19:00.270
<i>I see. I can get that.</i>

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:02.240
<i>But that makes me all the more depressed</i>

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:04.880
<i>when you tell me that whatever's going 
on has nothing to do with me...</i>

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.460
Good job, everyone!

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:11.580
First, congratulations to Mikage-san

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:15.420
for placing third in the 
B division small obstacle jump.

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:17.170
Congratulations!

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:18.960
Hachiken-kun,

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:22.730
congratulations for placing fourth 
in the C division small obstacle jump.

00:19:22.730 --> 00:19:23.640
Thanks.

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:27.460
Hey, so the club president 
didn't even place?

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:29.350
I'll be going all in at the Ezonoo Festival.

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:31.480
Hey, Mikage-chan.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:32.900
Congrats on placing third!

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:35.020
Oh, thanks!

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:37.650
I had a great time.

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:40.080
Horse riding is more fun than I'd thought!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.220
Right?

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:42.640
Horses are great, aren't they?

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:44.830
Yeah, horses are cool,

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:49.220
but I could really see how you love 
horses and have fun riding them,

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:50.870
so it was great to watch.

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:53.830
I'm kind of envious!

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:57.290
But you're having fun, too.

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:00.080
Well, sure.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:03.680
But I'm just thinking for 
myself all the time.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:06.930
Bro...

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:11.010
Why are you eating our meat?!

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:14.670
Just go back to work already!

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:15.710
Can you afford to be eating 
without a care in the world,

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:17.150
Mikage Aki?

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:20.340
If you couldn't place first, it doesn't matter 
if you placed second or one hundredth!

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:24.740
It means that you guys 
have finally reached my level!

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:29.340
You both should be thankful that you can 
compete on the same stage as myself!

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:27.590
Nice!

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:28.920
Keep it up!

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:30.360
Awesome!

00:20:29.340 --> 00:20:32.840
Try harder, Mikage Aki and Hachiken Yuugo!

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:31.420
Good going!

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:32.660
Give it to them!

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:36.050
That girl seemed to be having fun, too.

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:38.210
She finally learned my name...

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:40.340
Oh, crap!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:43.020
I need to get back for practicum 
duty at the cattle shed!

00:20:43.020 --> 00:20:44.080
Sorry, gotta go!

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:45.910
You're such a busy guy.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:48.060
Is there a bus route nearby?

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:51.190
There is, but the bus comes about 
once every one or two hours.

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:54.770
Crap! Now I gotta run home 
on a full stomach...

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:56.490
Hachiken-kun.

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:11.120
It's more fun to ride a horse 
down a road than I'd thought!

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:13.710
Horses are awesome!

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:14.160
Hey, Hachiken!

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:16.530
Don't forget to pick up after your horse!

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:50.630
This story is a work of fiction.
